 "text": "Hey there, how are you doing? That's a lovely idea. Would you like to pick a spot, or would you like help with that? Then look at the open fields, they' cheaper than palaces these days. Pick a field that overlooks a river, it's so lovely. Not cheesy at all, it's lovely. A small blanket and some sweets would make it feel special. Then keep the bag unopened until you' ready to set it up. Pick a spot and leave it there for at least an hour after you arrive, so it feels like you've stumbled upon it.",
